<title>USA: FORECAST - API data seen showing bearish crude build.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - API data seen showing bearish crude build.</headline>
<byline>Harry Milling</byline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>This week's stocks report from the American Petroleum Institute (API) is likely to show a bearish build in crude stocks, but bullish views about distillate stocks could limit a possible fall in crude prices.</p>
<p>Traders said the report due out late Tuesday is expected to show a somewhat small - and bullish - build in heating oil stocks, already at historical lows.</p>
<p>Gasoline is expected to show a slim draw, continuing a disappointing demand trend for gasoline throughout the summer, and refinery utilization rates are likely to remain steady.</p>
</text>
